  "description": "DEXDES crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R 3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H99 Co3 Dy3 N3 O27 1+,Cl1 O4 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.340-4.004 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.54-118.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H105ClN3O34Co3Dy3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
